<title>THAILAND: Bank of Thailand notes average yield 10.90 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Thailand notes average yield 10.90 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand announced on Friday the following result of its weekly notes auction:</p>
<p>   MATURITY  TENDER AMT   ALLOTED AMT    AVG YIELD    RANGE</p>
<p>		 (MLNS BAHT)  (MLNS BAHT)</p>
<p>    28 days    4,460	   2,000	  10.90     9.69-11.75</p>
<p>    91 days    2,635	   1,000	   9.92     8.80-10.50</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
